WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.215
Hey, flag! Tell us about yourself!

2
00:00:03.216 --> 00:00:07.772
"I am the Hinomaru, which means "sun disc."

3
00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:14.828
The sun disc, which is actually my red circle, has been the symbol of Japan for centuries.

4
00:00:14.829 --> 00:00:18.876
Many Japanese flags have used the sun disc.

5
00:00:18.877 --> 00:00:22.811
"You may have seen a different flag in a war movie.

6
00:00:22.812 --> 00:00:25.519
It is called the Rising Sun.

7
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.334
The Japanese navy used it during World War II.

8
00:00:29.335 --> 00:00:35.897
Some people think that it was the Japanese national flag during the war, but they are mistaken.

9
00:00:35.898 --> 00:00:39.603
The Rising Sun was only a military flag. "I

10
00:00:39.604 --> 00:00:43.985
have been the Japanese flag for a long time. "In

11
00:00:43.986 --> 00:00:49.106
the year 1274, the Mongols attacked Japan. Nichiren,

12
00:00:49.107 --> 00:00:57.430
a Japanese Buddhist priest, presented a sun flag to a very powerful Japanese warrior. He

13
00:00:57.431 --> 00:01:03.080
believed that with this symbol, the Japanese could defeat the Mongols. Ever

14
00:01:03.081 --> 00:01:10.440
since then, the sun disc has been an important symbol for the Japanese." Hey,

15
00:01:10.441 --> 00:01:13.366
flag! Tell us about yourself. "I

16
00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:17.180
am the flag of the People's Republic of China. I

17
00:01:17.181 --> 00:01:22.846
have been used since 1920, but I looked a little different back then. I

18
00:01:22.847 --> 00:01:27.157
got my new look in 1949. Red

19
00:01:27.158 --> 00:01:33.444
is the color of the Communist Revolution, which happened almost one hundred years ago. During

20
00:01:33.445 --> 00:01:38.971
the revolution, many people died to make China a communist country. "In

21
00:01:38.972 --> 00:01:47.053
a communist country, the goal is for all the people to be treated equally and for them to share all the wealth. So

22
00:01:47.054 --> 00:01:50.835
the Chinese people are proud of my red color. "I

23
00:01:50.836 --> 00:01:53.311
have five yellow stars. The

24
00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:57.274
large star represents the Communist Party of China. The Communist

25
00:01:57.275 --> 00:02:01.534
Party leads all the Chinese people. The four

26
00:02:01.535 --> 00:02:05.463
small stars represent the Chinese people. Some people

27
00:02:05.464 --> 00:02:13.354
say that the small stars represent the workers, farmers, scholars, and business owners. The five

28
00:02:13.355 --> 00:02:20.907
stars show that all the people are united under the Communist Party." Hey, flag!

29
00:02:20.908 --> 00:02:23.768
Tell us about yourself. "I am

30
00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:26.757
the flag of the Republic of Korea. You can

31
00:02:26.758 --> 00:02:29.532
call me the Taegeukgi. I have

32
00:02:29.533 --> 00:02:38.607
looked like this since 1950, but other flags similar to me have been used by Korean kings for hundreds of years. Many hundreds

33
00:02:38.608 --> 00:02:43.018
of years ago, my colors were very different. In 1882,

34
00:02:43.019 --> 00:02:47.562
I looked almost the same as I do now. Can you

35
00:02:47.563 --> 00:02:51.165
see the differences? "My design

36
00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:56.178
and colors have changed, but my meaning remains the same. It comes

37
00:02:56.179 --> 00:03:00.016
from a very old oriental philosophy. The circle

38
00:03:00.017 --> 00:03:07.402
in the center is a symbol of eum-yang , which the Chinese people call yin-yang .The

39
00:03:07.403 --> 00:03:12.814
blue part represents eum , which is negative, dark, and cold.

40
00:03:12.815 --> 00:03:18.330
The red part represents yang , which is positive, bright, and hot.

41
00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:22.861
Together, they symbolize balance and harmony.

42
00:03:22.862 --> 00:03:29.252
"The bar on my top-left side means the sky; the one on the top-right means water;

43
00:03:29.253 --> 00:03:35.601
the bottom-left one means fire; and the bottom-right one means the earth.

44
00:03:35.602 --> 00:03:42.499
"Most importantly, I am not a flag of war, but one that stands for peace and harmony.

45
00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:48.903
Even my white background represents peace and purity.

46
00:03:48.904 --> 00:03:54.219
"If you want to know about the history of a country, start by learning about its flag.

47
00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:58.899
A flag can speak a thousand words."

